.SH NAME
background_summary \- summary of the background model as dataframe
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIbackground_summary(\fBbackground\fR as <generic> Background, 
\fBgene_names\fR as boolean = TRUE);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
summary of the background model as dataframe
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBbackground\fB \fR\- the GSEA background model object.. 
.PP
.PP
\fBgene_names\fB \fR\- 
 writes the gene names in the \fBfactors\fR column when \fBTRUE\fR (default), otherwise
 writes the gene accession ids.
. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
a \fBdataframe\fR of the cluster information, the row names are the cluster ids and
 the columns are \fBclass\fR, \fBcategory\fR, \fBname\fR, \fBdescription\fR,
 \fBcluster_size\fR and \fBfactors\fR (the member gene ids joined by \fB;\fR).
.PP
